  "text": {
    "name": "SARS",
    "rules": "Record \"outbreak\". Each side chooses: Report cases openly? If LIO says yes, LIO spends 1 point on actions; otherwise, until the end of this turn, each time LIO spends points, it spends 1 more, then draw from the Contingency deck of the side that played this card, then if the result is 3 or more, at the end of this turn, SAE spends 1 point placing influence. If SAE says yes, SAE spends 1 point on actions; otherwise, until the end of this turn, each time SAE spends points, it spends 1 more, then draw from the Contingency deck of the side that played this card, then if the result is 3 or more, at the end of this turn, LIO spends 1 point placing influence. If both say no, each of these end-of-turn spends that happens is for 2 points, because the spender's own \"it spends 1 more\" is still in force.",
